        <mxCell id="pool-obj" value="&lt;b&gt;TObjectPool&amp;lt;GameObject&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;청크 32슬롯 · 주소 불변 (compaction 없음)&lt;br&gt;ForEachObject(fn) — live 만 방문&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e2f0d9;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
